  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I Complex</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
